      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Unclear if there is any bug here.\n\nJust to be clear, this is not this bug: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/avatar-changes-sometimes-revert-back-to-the-previously-used-avatar-immediately-a\n\nAn avatar's saved parameters are saved locally in `%LocalAppdata%Low\\VRChat\\VRChat\\LocalAvatarData\\[userid]\\[avatarid]`, when an avatar's parameters has been setup by its author to save between worlds. Any parameters that are not saved will be reset to default between worlds and when calibrating full-body tracking.\n\nLoading a local SDK test avatar will always load the default avatar parameter values.\n\nAt times, the local avatar data may be reset even without avatar updates but I'm not sure when exactly that happens on the same computer with local avatar data.",
