      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So VRChat has a button to clear a cache, next to this button are two other buttons.\n\n* Clear texture cache -- I don't understand this, but it's there. \n\n* Clear avatar data -- this clears out all avatar settings\n\nI don't know if these have a confirmation prompt or not, but have a friend who needed to be told twice to stop hitting the clear avatar data button. Maybe that one should be nudged away from the cache clearing buttons.",
